          "reason": "key_text 与 query 的命中不对应。query 问的是 advocate 的「资格与独立性要求」以及「在哪些情况下不要求指定 advocate」，而 key_text「the IRB must require that an advocate be appointed for each child who is a ward」只说明在 50.56(a) 下须指定 advocate，既未含资格要件，也未含独立性限制或豁免情形，属于铺垫句而非答案最小命中。页内直接回答该 query 的原文为「The advocate must be an individual who has the background and experience to act in, and agrees to act in, the best interest of the child for the duration of the child's participation in the clinical investigation」「The advocate must not be associated in any way (except in the role as advocate or member of the IRB) with the clinical investigation, the investigator(s), or the guardian organization」与「FDA regulations do not require the appointment of an advocate for children who are wards involved in clinical investigations approved under these sections」。evidence_span 本身覆盖了两问，偏移与文本一致（1062–2812，长度 1750，long_context 成立），故仅 key_text 需改。",
